cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use mapcan in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "mapcan: CAN signal maps as code"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ali
    family-names: Ordu
repository-code: "https://github.com/ordu1453/mapcan"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.25.0
date-released: 2026-10-29
keywords:
  - CAN
  - CAN FD
  - CANopen
  - SAE J1939
  - DBC
  - code generation
abstract: >-
  mapcan describes CAN signal maps in a single YAML file and generates
  documentation (PDF, Excel, Markdown, HTML), DBC files, C firmware code
  and Python test helpers from it, with validation that points to the
  exact file, line and column.
